d_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\n4.7.stable\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.7.stable - Windows 11 (build 26200) - Multi-window, 2 monitors - Direct3D 12 (Forward+) - dedicated AMD Radeon RX 7800 XT (Advanced Micro Devices, Inc.; 32.0.31021.5001) - AMD Ryzen 9 7900X 12-Core Processor (24 threads) - 31.21 GiB memory - WASAPI (48000 Hz, Stereo/mono)\n\n### Issue description\n\nWhen using MSDF fonts, their baselines don't align.\n\n<img width=\"1974\" height=\"1375\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/39bda35f-1db9-4a29-a8d8-16654a633fe9\" />\n\nThe lower the resolution of the MSDF the more pronounced the issue, but it is a general issue, you can see the baseline skipping up and down as you adjust MSDF resolution, so it appears it's some sub-pixel alignment that's missing.\n\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/47d14e88-9799-40b3-83c4-26d80f9fab06\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nAdd a label with an MSDF font and adjust the MSDF resolution.\n\nOR\n\nSee attached project.\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[msdf_font_baseline_2026-07-14_16-59-44.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/30015743/msdf_font_baseline_2026-07-14_16-59-44.zip)","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events